[E-REFL] Error: `rfl` can't prove this
    ╭─[ goals/param-default-shown.sw:15:64 ]
    │
 15 │ theorem rangeShape (a: Nat) (b: Nat): range a b = [a, b, 2] := rfl
    │                                                                ─┬─  
    │                                                                 ╰─── `range a b` and `[a, b, 2]` aren't equal
    │ 
    │ Note 1: computing the left side gives `[a, b, 1]`
    │ 
    │ Note 2: `rfl` proves `a = b` only when both sides compute to the same value
    │ 
    │ Note 3: this statement is false; a counterexample:
    │           a = 0
    │           b = 0
    │         `range a b = [a, b, 2]` is false:
    │           left:  [0, 0, 1]
    │           right: [0, 0, 2]
    │           first difference at [2]: 1 vs 2
────╯
